I walk to a large supermarket in Kochi.
The weather is good today.
I enter the supermarket.
I take a cart from there.
I want a few things for my kitchen.
I mainly want rice and lentils.
I walk to the rice section.
There are many types of rice here.
I want Kerala rice.
I take a large five-kilo packet.
It is very heavy.
I put it in my cart.
Then, I look for lentils.
I see a packet of yellow lentils.
I want that too.
I put those lentils in the cart too.
I take a packet of milk too.
Now there are important items in my cart.
